# The build context for deploy/narration-runner and deploy/narration-agent (both built
# from the repo root). An allowlist: the images need only pipeline/, so everything else
# (.git, .venv, .worktrees, .superpowers, .env files, audio) stays out of the context.
*
!pipeline/
pipeline/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.env
**/*.wav
**/*.mp3
**/*.m4a
